# Qualitative Outcome Coder

React + Vite + TypeScript app that uses the Google Gemini API to batch-code qualitative outcome text against configurable codebooks.

## Stack
- **Frontend:** React 19, Vite 6, TypeScript
- **AI:** `@google/genai` via `services/geminiService.ts`
- **Secrets:** `GEMINI_API_KEY` in `.env.local` (never commit)

## Layout (flat root, no `src/`)
- `App.tsx` — main app shell and batch upload flow
- `components/` — UI (ReviewDashboard, ResultDisplay, ProcessingStatus, etc.)
- `services/geminiService.ts` — Gemini integration and batch processing
- `types.ts` — shared TypeScript interfaces
- `constants.ts` — codebook definitions and prompt instructions
- `docs/specs/` — PRDs and technical specs (use with @product, @architect)

## Commands
```bash
npm install
npm run dev      # local dev server
npm run build    # production build
npm run preview  # preview production build
```

